WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.535
You can smoke-test without an ads budget.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.346
Landing plus outbound is enough.

00:00:04.346 --> 00:00:07.243
This lesson is about smoke tests without ads.

00:00:07.243 --> 00:00:08.330
Landing + outbound.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:10.865
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:10.865 --> 00:00:14.486
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:14.486 --> 00:00:19.918
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:19.918 --> 00:00:23.902
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:23.902 --> 00:00:28.248
Stay practical: draft a smoke-test CTA before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:28.568 --> 00:00:35.835
Draft a simple page or doc with the offer, then send it to warm contacts with a clear call to action.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.258
Remember the objective: draft a smoke-test CTA.

00:00:38.258 --> 00:00:42.064
Write the idea in your own words before you move on.

00:00:42.064 --> 00:00:46.217
Name one concrete next action you can finish in under an hour.

00:00:46.217 --> 00:00:50.023
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:00:50.023 --> 00:00:54.176
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:00:54.496 --> 00:00:59.816
Draft a smoke-test CTA: what to do next, by when, and what they get.

